  title: Grocery List
  content: "Market List\n\n\u25A1 Flour\n\u25A1 Lamp oil\n\u25A1 New sewing thread\n\u25A1
    Apples (if they're finally in season)\n\u25A1 Lily's favorite honey biscuits\n\u25A1
    Return borrowed cookbook to Mrs. Rowan\n\nRemember:\nAsk if the traveling merchant
    still sells flower seeds."
